{"id":5260,"date":"2024-09-30T14:34:22","date_gmt":"2024-09-30T10:34:22","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/waytransittourism.com\/?p=5260"},"modified":"2026-07-05T00:01:13","modified_gmt":"2026-07-04T20:01:13","slug":"celebrate-the-uae-national-holiday-with-a-memorable-group-trip-to-baku","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/waytransittourism.com\/celebrate-the-uae-national-holiday-with-a-memorable-group-trip-to-baku\/","title":{"rendered":"Celebrate the UAE National Holiday with a Memorable Group Trip to Baku!"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Looking for an exciting way to celebrate the UAE National Holiday? Join us for a <strong>4-day, 3-night group tour<\/strong> to the vibrant city of <strong>Baku, Azerbaijan<\/strong>, from <strong>December 1 to December 4, 2024<\/strong>. Explore the perfect blend of ancient history and modern architecture, surrounded by scenic landscapes and rich culture.<\/p>\n<p>This group trip is ideal for solo travelers, families, and friends seeking a unique and affordable getaway, all while taking advantage of easy <strong>installment payments<\/strong> through <strong>Tabby<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<div class=\"su-note\"  style=\"border-color:#d4e5e4;border-radius:20px;-moz-border-radius:20px;-webkit-border-radius:20px;\"><div class=\"su-note-inner su-u-clearfix su-u-trim\" style=\"background-color:#eefffe;border-color:#ffffff;color:#333333;border-radius:20px;-moz-border-radius:20px;-webkit-border-radius:20px;\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #6b003e;\"><b><strong>Rates with Tabby Financing:<\/strong><\/b><\/span><\/h3>\n<p>We\u2019ve made it even more convenient with <strong>affordable prices<\/strong> and the option to pay in installments!<\/p>\n<p><strong>Single Room:<\/strong> AED 2,420 per person<br \/>\n<strong>Double\/Triple Room:<\/strong> AED 2,104 per person<br \/>\n<strong>Infant Fare:<\/strong> AED 842<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<div class=\"su-note\"  style=\"border-color:#e5e4c1;border-radius:3px;-moz-border-radius:3px;-webkit-border-radius:3px;\"><div class=\"su-note-inner su-u-clearfix su-u-trim\" style=\"background-color:#fffedb;border-color:#ffffff;color:#333333;border-radius:3px;-moz-border-radius:3px;-webkit-border-radius:3px;\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #6b003e;\"><b><strong>What&#8217;s Included:<\/strong><\/b><\/span><\/h3>\n<div class=\"su-list\" style=\"margin-left:0px\">\n<p>We\u2019ve curated an all-inclusive package to make your trip as enjoyable and stress-free as possible:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><i class=\"sui sui-star\" style=\"color:#978827\"><\/i> <span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #993300;\"><b><strong>3 Nights Stay\u00a0<\/strong><\/b><\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">at <strong>I\u0307stanbul Gold Hotel<\/strong> (3*) or similar<\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><i class=\"sui sui-star\" style=\"color:#978827\"><\/i> <span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #993300;\"><b><strong>Daily Breakfast<\/strong><\/b><\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u00a0to kick-start your mornings<\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><i class=\"sui sui-star\" style=\"color:#978827\"><\/i> <span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #993300;\"><b><strong>Round-trip Airport Transfers <\/strong><\/b><\/span><\/span>on a shared (SIC) basis<\/li>\n<li><i class=\"sui sui-star\" style=\"color:#978827\"><\/i> <span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #993300;\"><b><strong>Guided Tour of Old &amp; Modern Baku <\/strong><\/b><\/span><\/span>showcasing the city&#8217;s top attractions<\/li>\n<li><i class=\"sui sui-star\" style=\"color:#978827\"><\/i> <span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #993300;\"><b><strong>Full-Day Tour to Gobustan &amp; Absheron<\/strong><\/b><\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> experiencing the natural beauty and cultural heritage<\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><i class=\"sui sui-star\" style=\"color:#978827\"><\/i> <span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #993300;\"><b><strong>Travel Insurance <\/strong><\/b><\/span><\/span>for peace of mind<\/li>\n<li><i class=\"sui sui-star\" style=\"color:#978827\"><\/i> <span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #993300;\"><b><strong>Round-trip flights <\/strong><\/b><\/span><\/span>via <strong>Air Arabia<\/strong> (Abu Dhabi &#8211; Baku &#8211; Abu Dhabi)<\/li>\n<li><i class=\"sui sui-star\" style=\"color:#978827\"><\/i> <span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #993300;\"><b><strong>7KG Hand Carry Baggage<\/strong><\/b><\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> allowance<\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><i class=\"sui sui-star\" style=\"color:#978827\"><\/i> <span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #993300;\"><b><strong>20KG Check-in Baggage <\/strong><\/b><\/span><\/span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">allowance<\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<div class=\"su-note\"  style=\"border-color:#e5d0bb;border-radius:20px;-moz-border-radius:20px;-webkit-border-radius:20px;\"><div class=\"su-note-inner su-u-clearfix su-u-trim\" style=\"background-color:#ffead5;border-color:#ffffff;color:#333333;border-radius:20px;-moz-border-radius:20px;-webkit-border-radius:20px;\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #6b003e;\"><b><strong>Flight Details:<\/strong><\/b><\/span><\/h3>\n<p><strong>DECEMBER 01, 2024 Airlines:<\/strong> Air Arabia \u27083L 730: Abu Dhabi \u2192 13:30 \u27083L 730: Baku \u2192 16:40<\/p>\n<p><strong>DECEMBER 04, 2024 Airlines:<\/strong> Air Arabia \u27083L 731: Baku \u2192 13:40 \u27083L 731: Abu Dhabi \u2192 16:35<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<div class=\"su-note\"  style=\"border-color:#d4e5e4;border-radius:20px;-moz-border-radius:20px;-webkit-border-radius:20px;\"><div class=\"su-note-inner su-u-clearfix su-u-trim\" style=\"background-color:#eefffe;border-color:#ffffff;color:#333333;border-radius:20px;-moz-border-radius:20px;-webkit-border-radius:20px;\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #6b003e;\"><b><strong>Itinerary Overview:<\/strong><\/b><\/span><\/h3>\n<p id=\"ember66\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\"><strong>Day 1<\/strong>: Arrival in Baku and transfer to the hotel for check-in.<\/p>\n<p id=\"ember67\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\"><strong>Day 2<\/strong>: Explore the best of <strong>Old &amp; Modern Baku<\/strong>with a guided city tour.<\/p>\n<p id=\"ember68\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\"><strong>Day 3<\/strong>: Spend a full day discovering <strong>Gobustan &amp; Absheron<\/strong>, with its UNESCO-listed rock art and fascinating natural formations.<\/p>\n<p id=\"ember69\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\"><strong>Day 4<\/strong>: Departure from Baku, with unforgettable memories of Azerbaijan.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p id=\"ember70\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\"><strong>Exclusions:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p id=\"ember71\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\">While our package includes many great perks, please note the following exclusions:<\/p>\n<p id=\"ember72\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\">\u274c Additional Tours<\/p>\n<p id=\"ember73\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\">\u274c On Arrival Visa Fees<\/p>\n<p id=\"ember74\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\">\u274c VAT\/Taxes<\/p>\n<p id=\"ember75\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\">\u274c Lunches and Dinners<\/p>\n<p id=\"ember76\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\">\u274c\u00a0Other expenses not mentioned in the inclusions<\/p>\n<p id=\"ember77\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\"><strong>Important Information:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"reader-text-block__code-block\">Fares and seats are subject to availability at the time of booking.<\/li>\n<li class=\"reader-text-block__code-block\">Fare Rule: No modifications, cancellations, or refunds will be permitted for this offer.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p id=\"ember78\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\">Make your UAE National Holiday a memorable one by joining us on this incredible journey to <strong>Baku<\/strong>. Whether you&#8217;re a history buff, a lover of modern architecture, or just looking to relax, this tour has something for everyone!<\/p>\n<p id=\"ember79\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\"><strong>Reserve your spot today<\/strong> and get ready for a fun-filled holiday adventure!<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Looking for an exciting way to celebrate the UAE National Holiday? Join us for a 4-day, 3-night group tour to the vibrant city of Baku, Azerbaijan, from December 1 to December 4, 2024. Explore the perfect blend of ancient history and modern architecture, surrounded by scenic landscapes and rich culture. This group trip is ideal [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":9,"featured_media":5262,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[97,80],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-5260","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-news","category-holiday-destinations"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/waytransittourism.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5260","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/waytransittourism.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/waytransittourism.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/waytransittourism.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/9"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/waytransittourism.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=5260"}],"version-history":[{"count":11,"href":"https:\/\/waytransittourism.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5260\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5273,"href":"https:\/\/waytransittourism.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pos